NAME
    gcloud beta app-lifecycle-manager flags releases - manage App Lifecycle
        Manager Flags Releases

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta app-lifecycle-manager flags releases COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA)

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (BETA) Create Flag Release.

     delete
        (BETA) Delete Flag Release.

     describe
        (BETA) Describe Flag Revision.

     list
        (BETA) List Flags Releases.

     update
        (BETA) Update Flag Release.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice.

